A \emph{substrate TQFT} is a symmetric monoidal functor


\[
Z : \mathbf{Bord}_1^{\mathrm{fr}} \to \mathbf{Sub}_\infty
\]


assigning
\begin{align*}
Z(\{i\}) &= O_i,\\
Z([i \to j]) &= \Lambda_{ij}.
\end{align*}
\end{definition}
