Substrates are classified by algebras over the $\infty$-operad


\[
\mathcal{P}_\infty = \langle \Lambda,\Phi,\Xi,d\Omega,\mathrm{VOID} \rangle_\infty.
\]


\end{theorem}

\begin{theorem}[Equivalence via operadic maps]
Two substrates are equivalent if and only if their corresponding
